---
import Layout from "@/layouts/main.astro";
import Container from "@/layouts/container.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Container class="py-20">
    <!-- Title -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-light opacity-90">about numa</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Philosophy -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80 pt-8">
      <p>
        numa is a series of minimalist sound journals. each mix captures a
        single feeling, a moment in time, translated into sound.
      </p>

      <p>
        in a world that moves too fast, these mixes are meant for calm spaces
        and unhurried hours. for mornings with coffee, late-night contemplation,
        or the quiet moments in between.
      </p>

      <p>
        the process is simple: curate sounds that resonate with a specific mood
        or memory, blend them into a seamless journey, and let them exist as a
        journal entry: a timestamp of how it felt to be alive in that
        particular moment.
      </p>

      <p>
        each mix is numbered, not titled with grand names, because they're meant
        to be modest companions rather than statements. they're here to
        accompany you, not to demand your attention.
      </p>

      <p class="pt-4 opacity-60 text-xs">
        created with intention.<br />
        shared with care.<br />
        received with gratitude.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Optional: Link back -->
    <div class="text-center pt-8">
      <a
        href="/mixes"
        class="inline-block text-sm opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity border-b border-current pb-1"
      >
        explore the mixes →
      </a>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
